<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;&lt;c&gt;-&gt;last_insert_id&lt;/c&gt; is a method of the database handle, not of the statement handle (see [https://metacpan.org/pod/DBI#last_insert_id|last_insert_id]). So you want to call it on the database handle:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
$dbh-&gt;last_insert_id()
&lt;/c&gt;</doctext>
